  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 200C, fan-forced. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Crush or finely chop the garlic. Trim the lettuce, then coarsely tear the leaves. Thinly slice the cucumber. Cut the tomato into thin wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2129908/photos/large/62287_1-5dd746a20cd6dd9204de57442897e5a5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake croutons: Combine the garlic and 2 tsp olive oil in a bowl and season with salt and pepper. Cut the bread rolls into 1cm chunks and put on the lined tray. Drizzle with the garlic oil and toss to coat. Bake for 6-8 mins until golden and crisp.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2129909/photos/large/62287_2-05d877d6cc535ec26074f38b492b3855.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toast pepitas: Meanwhile, put the pepitas in a cold medium frypan over medium heat. Toast, tossing, for 3-4 mins until evenly golden. Remove from the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2129910/photos/large/62287_3-a555177b6b2f76a6a9afc200643505f5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm tofu: Heat 2 tsp olive oil in the same pan over medium heat. Cook the tofu for 2-3 mins each side until golden and warmed through. Remove from the pan and thinly slice.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2129911/photos/large/62287_4-57cb57ac7e2e9aac694323ec444a9416.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss salad and serve up: Combine 1 tbs vegan mayonnaise (see Make it yours), 2 tsp white wine vinegar and 1 tsp water in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the lettuce, cucumber and tomato and toss to coat. Add the croutons and toss to combine. Divide the salad among bowls, top with the tofu and scatter over the pepitas. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2129912/photos/large/62287_5-54cf5593704166157ac807e9ce824aaa.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you aren't following a vegan diet, feel free to use whatever mayo you have on hand.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2129913/photos/large/62287_6-d77856fbe4a2562be5a7a2a9f9513cf8.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
